    narr:narration """This narrative holds a single position: [winter hours set to Saturdays only, with a second volunteer added for returns](narr:Position_ToolLibraryWinterHoursAndSaturdayStaffing). Wren reports the turnout observation — weekday evenings drew four borrowers in six weeks — and [Jun](narr:Position_ToolLibraryWinterHoursAndSaturdayStaffing) draws the staffing consequence. The frame asks what the observed turnout says about when the library should open and what the remaining shift needs; both parts are answered within this one position.""" ;
